### USER OPERATIONS
### FIND ALL USERS
GET http://localhost:3000/users

### CREATE USER
POST http://localhost:3000/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser3",
  "password": "12345"
}

### LOGIN USER

POST http://localhost:3000/users/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "testuser3",
  "password": "12345"
}

### POST OPERATIONS
### FIND POST BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/posts/5
### SAVE POST
POST http://localhost:3000/posts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": 5,
  "body": "hey! this is the first post!"
}
### EDIT POST
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/20
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "body": "Logged in user: updated text!!!"
}

### ERROR: EDIT POST
PATCH http://localhost:3000/posts/6
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "body": "updated text!!!"
}

### COMMENT OPERATIONS
### FIND COMMENTS BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/user/5
### FIND COMMENTS BY POST_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/comments/post/10
### CREATE COMMENT
POST http://localhost:3000/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "post_id": 10,
  "user_id": 5,
  "body": "hey comments are visible!"
}
### DELETE COMMENT BY ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/comments/11

### LIKE OPERATIONS
### COUNT LIKES BY POST_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/likes/post/10
### FIND LIKES BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/likes/user/5
### IS POST LIKED BY USER_ID
GET http://localhost:3000/likes/post/10/user/5